--- SECURITY (CRITICAL) ---

Never upload environment variables containing API keys or passwords

.env
.env.local
.env.*

--- Python System Files ---

These are compiled python files that are generated automatically

pycache/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

--- Virtual Environment ---

Ignore the folder where your python libraries are installed

.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

--- Project Outputs ---

We don't want to track every single PDF generated

reports/
*.pdf

Ignore the cache file so your local testing doesn't mess up the repo

cache_summaries.json

--- OS & Editor Files ---

Annoying system files created by Mac/Windows or VS Code

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

--- Logs ---

Ignore log files generated during runtime

*.log